WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
There is a price

2
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:02,440
My brother is so boring

3
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,480
If you have the time, go kill the mourner yourself

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,720
Wouldn't it be better to find more supplies?

5
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,480
You have to work with others to dominate others

6
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,940
How many people in your base don’t need it?

7
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:15,580
There are more than 200 people in our base

8
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,420
They are all folks from our village and nearby villages.

9
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,640
What is the population ratio?

10
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,200
There are many elderly people in the village

11
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:25,040
There are less than fifty young people like me and my brother

12
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:28,610
Then why don't your brother hurry up and hug his thigh?

13
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:31,750
I got there too late and couldn't even catch anyone during the search.

14
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:33,310
You can't rely on anyone

15
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:34,350
This desert world

16
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:38,040
We can only eat together on our own

17
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,560
i like to listen to you

18
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,120
I can't speak

19
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,700
from childhood to adulthood

20
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:47,100
No one in my family likes to listen to me. I want to hear you continue. Just come to me.
